runtime and entry scripts, fixed commit 1edde3655c676bd44990ce9762d6b8f73334ed1d.
python-evtx copyright 2012, 2013 Willi Ballenthin, while at Mandiant.
Its complete Apache License 2.0 is retained in licenses/python-evtx-Apache-2.0.txt.
Original authors retain authorship; the applicant is not represented as the sole
original author of python-evtx. Its README credits Andreas Schuster's EVTX format
research and Parse-Evtx work. That attribution is preserved as historical context;
Parse-Evtx code was not audited, copied, bundled or invoked here.

The new runtime does not import or wrap python-evtx or hexdump. Its AST, bounded
cursors, typed value model, event projection, corruption/coverage ledger, CLI and
synthetic fixture writer are independently written. The local snapshot-reader
pattern is shared with other Codex-assisted projects in this portfolio; it is
not presented as a novel EVTX format algorithm or a separate original invention.

Microsoft MS-EVEN6 selected technical specifications and libyal/libevtx's fixed
EVTX format document informed binary semantics. Their text and implementations
are not bundled. Original upstream parser plus hexdump 3.3 and frozen binary
fixtures were used only as research verification dependencies. No upstream
fixture, raw event contents or third-party runtime is shipped in these packages.
